      {
        "annotation_id": "56696135d4954797885f140ff4a63a08_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Whether or not the cost of a good or service is affordable or exorbitant is unrelated to the conditions of entry enforced by a business."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e8b3dbe86b6041f18c5337dc4ea29535_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "31. The condition of entry is imposed as a direct result of the exercise of the right of cinema owners to carry on a business or trade under Article 19(1)(g) of the Constitution."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "deb3174306a14b98a8984c904a43083a_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The commercial logic of prohibiting movie goers from carrying their own food to the cinema hall is to stimulate and boost a vital aspect of the business ?\nthe sale of food and beverages."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3015d1326d5741719f651b493735ab04_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "If business owners are not permitted to determine the various facets of their business (in accordance with law), economic activity would come to a grinding halt."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f5c14a3e449b423b971064befe048ee7_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "While movie goers may have no choice but to sign on the proverbial dotted line (and thereby not carry any food of their own into the theatre)\nin order to enter the cinema hall and watch a movie of their choice, this does not by itself rende"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fd0d774e517e40beb4d88b55dbe71eb4_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "32. Most businesses impose some or the other condition which the customer may find less than ideal."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "47ee7759d79e485b86f56b6e8942b829_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "For instance, many private museums do not permit customers to take photographs of the objects on display."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b6fd8cac433d4d6b910e343c08e03e6e_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This is also true of many clothing boutiques or jewellery stores."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d3701af2473a409eb8d33f7dffef85da_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Audience members are often banned from recording musical performances at concerts."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bb92822eff73418d99099bb2dee18fe0_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Music festivals, much like movie theatres, do not permit attendees to carry their own food or beverages to the venue."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "147e83dd8f684aa29557cd7760195536_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Similar is the case with stand-up comedy shows or plays that are conducted in collaboration with eateries or bars."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d2abe6895a4f4b659704a65367a96329_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Although the customer is paying for a ticket to watch the music performance (or the standup act or the play, as the case may be), the essence of the business model is to provide a fillip to the revenue generated by another arm of the busine"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9667ed18b2d54f0e9439c8a0a940cb0a_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This being the case, movie goers are bound by the condition of entry determined by the theatre owners in the instant case i.e., the prohibition on carrying food and beverages from outside into the precincts of the movie hall.\""
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e6dc5e8340c54282b7942922e964889b_41",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "6. In view of the aforesaid, we see no reason to proceed in the matter any further."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "16dd546331a741908c7f47cc3c2509e4_42",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n7. Petition is disposed of in terms of the aforesaid judgment."
      }
    ],
